    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ella Dunphy are delighted to present this impressive four-bedroom detached residence to the market. Offering generous and well-appointed accommodation throughout, this property is ideally suited to modern family living while enjoying a peaceful setting with excellent connectivity to surrounding towns.\n\nThe ground floor benefits from underfloor heating, providing a comfortable and efficient heating solution throughout the main living accommodation. The property offers a well-balanced layout with spacious living areas and four generously proportioned bedrooms, making it an ideal home for families.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a large, low-maintenance rear garden, providing an excellent private, not overlooked, outdoor space that is ideal for relaxing and entertaining without the upkeep associated with a more traditional garden. Side access provides additional convenience, while the property also benefits from a large shed, offering excellent additional storage or potential workshop space.\n\nThe location is particularly appealing, with Callan approximately 8 minutes away, providing a range of everyday amenities and services. Kilkenny City and Clonmel are both approximately 25 minutes away, offering a wider selection of shopping, schools, restaurants, and recreational facilities.\n\nCombining spacious accommodation, excellent outdoor space and a convenient location, this four-bedroom detached home presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable family residence within easy reach of both Kilkenny and Clonmel.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate what this property has to offer.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nEntrance Hall - Tiled flooring with useful under-stairs storage.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - Bright and spacious kitchen/dining area with tiled flooring, ample cupboard space and integrated appliances. Double doors provide direct access to the rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - Tiled flooring with additional storage space and convenient access to the rear garden.\n\nLiving Room - Generously proportioned living room with wooden flooring, a marble mantelpiece and a wood-burning fireplace, creating a warm and inviting focal point.\n\nGuest WC - Fully tiled with classic white WC and WHB.\n\nBedroom 1 / Office - Versatile single bedroom or home office with laminate wooden flooring.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 2 - Large double bedroom with laminate wooden flooring and built-in wardrobe space.\n\nEn-Suite - Fully tiled with classic white WC and WHB, power shower and Velux skylight.\n\nBedroom 3 - Double bedroom with laminate wooden flooring.\n\nMain Bathroom - Fully tiled with bath, power shower, classic white WC and WHB.\n\nBedroom 4 - Large double bedroom with laminate wooden flooring and built-in wardrobe space."
      },
      {
